📌 About This Repository

This repository contains a collection of cybersecurity practicals performed as part of academic learning. These practicals focus on understanding cybersecurity concepts, basic security tools, system protection, network security, and safe analysis techniques.

🎯 Objectives

* Understand fundamental concepts of cybersecurity.
* Learn about network security and common security threats.
* Perform basic security analysis using practical tools.
* Understand authentication, access control, and security monitoring.
* Develop awareness of ethical hacking and responsible security practices.
